BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Andre is an Idiot
DTSTART:20260411T000000Z
DTEND:20260411T015500Z
DTSTAMP:20260411T000000Z
UID:74nKhnxE23
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nAndre\, a brilliant idiot\, is dy
 ing because he didn’t get a colonoscopy. His sobering diagnosis\, comple
 te irreverence\, and insatiable curiosity\, send him on an unexpected jour
 ney learning how to die happily and ridiculously without losing his sense 
 of humor. Q&A following the 7:30pm screening on April 10 with Lee Einhorn
  (Executive Producer and Co-subject)\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-the
 aters/andre-is-an-idiot\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
