UID:FMXEfosYce
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nThe great Ian Mckellen and "I Ma
 y Destroy You's" Michaela Coel make a brilliant pairing in Oscar winner St
 even Soderbergh's incisively witty chamber comedy about art\, commerce\, 
 and avarice.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-christophers\n
 \nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
