 nterviewing its reclusive star\, Chiyoko Fujiwara\, who had retired from t
 he spotlight 30 years prior. As she recounts her career\, Genya and his cr
 ew are literally pulled into her memories where they witness her chance en
 counter with a mysterious man on the run from the police. Despite never kn
 owing his name or his face\, Chiyoko relentlessly pursues that man in a se
 amless blend of reality and memory that only Satoshi Kon could deliver.\n\
 nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/ani-marathon/millennium-actress\
