SUMMARY:The Invite
DTSTART:20260518T020000Z
DTEND:20260518T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T020000Z
UID:g2wD31Ftqe
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nThe 52nd annual Seattle Internat
 ional Film Festival will reach its conclusion with A24’s The Invite on M
 ay 17\, 2026\, with director & star Olivia Wilde scheduled to attend. This
  sendoff of the SIFF Effect will take place at SIFF Cinema Downtown at 7pm
 . After ten days of pure cinelation\, the Festival will have highlighted i
 ndependent artists and underrepresented voices from over 70 countries. Our
  audiences have been brought together by the collective laughter\, gasps\,
  and awe inspired by unforgettable filmmaking.  Secure your Closing Night
  Film tickets today for one final evening before the curtain closes the 20
 26 Festival.   Please note that the Closing Night feature will not be fo
 llowed by a party\; you’ll find your community seated next to you in the
  cinema!  Members: Make sure to sign in to your SIFF account before selec
 ting tickets. Closing Night Tickets: $40 ($35 SIFF Member)Film at SIFF Ci
 nema Downtown Browse all Festival passes and ticket packs.\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/festival/closing-night-2026\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
